function MechaAdapter:BakeLighting()
	print("[MechaAdapter] Baking lighting for photorealistic mode - Calling backend /api/ang/bake + GI/AO/Lighting 8K PBR - ARKHER AI v1 + Substance - BETA FINAL Top1")
