-- ALPHA 0.7 POLISHED - Polimento Total Fase 0-4
-- This file now loads MainControllerV2 polished - UI amigavel + Monaco Pro + Engineer Blender++ + Motion GTA 6 + ARKHER AI v1
-- For backward compatibility, old code is kept in MainControllerV1.luau if needed

